<title>USA: Capital Savings Bancorp Q2 Dec 31 net up.</title>
<headline>Capital Savings Bancorp Q2 Dec 31 net up.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY, Mo. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.29		    $0.24</p>
<p> Net			    537			472</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   1,881		    1,992</p>
<p>			6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.22		   $ 0.46</p>
<p> Net			    412			915</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   1,893		    1,987</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Capital Savings Bancorp Inc.</p>
<p>Year-ago share results restated for two-for-one stock split completed November 22, 1996.</p>
<p>Current six-month results include charge of $0.31/shr for Savings Association Insurance Fund recapitalization. Excluding the special assessment, income for the six months would have been $1 million or $0.53/shr.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
